# Text files stay LF in every checkout, a Windows one too: zsh reads these files, and the contract tests between the
# zsh engine and Lotus for Windows compare their bytes. Batch files are the exception – cmd.exe wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
